  "text": "Anthony Calo, DVM, Practice Limited to Oncology | Allegheny Veterinary Emergency Trauma & Specialty (AVETS)\nSkip to Primary Content\nContact Us\nContact Us\nMap\n2674 Monroeville Blvd.,\nMonroeville,\nPA,\n15146\nCall\n(412) 373-4200\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(412) 373-4200\nAddress:\n2674 Monroeville Blvd.,\nMonroeville,\nPA,\n15146\nBlog\nOrder Food & Medicine\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency Care\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCritical Care\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOncology\nRadioactive Iodine Therapy (I-131)\nSurgery\nView All Services\nPet Owners\nGeneral Info\nFinancial Information\nPet Owner FAQs\nFor Veterinarians\nCareers\nEmergency\nContact Us\nOncology\nAnthony Calo, DVM, Practice Limited to Oncology\nOncology\nAnthony Calo, DVM, Practice Limited to Oncology\n“My lifelong passion is to celebrate the human animal bond. The path I have taken to meet this goal is through the art and science of veterinary oncology.”\nEducation\nOncology Residency, Tufts University School of Veterinary Medicine, 2002-2004\nClinical Training and Internship in Small Animal Medicine, The University of Minnesota College of Veterinary Medicine, 1999-2000\nDoctor of Veterinary Medicine, Ross School of Veterinary Medicine, 1999\nBachelor of Science, Animal Science, Rutgers University, 1993\nProfessional Experience\nExtensive training in feline mammary gland carcinoma, lymphoproliferative disorders, neuroendocrine tumors, and medical oncology at the Tufts University School of Veterinary Medicine.\nPersonal Interest\nDr. Calo has a special interest in the human-animal bond. His approach to veterinary oncology focuses on the medical aspects of chemotherapy, immunotherapy, and radiation therapy.\nAvets Specialty & Emergency Trauma Center\n2674 Monroeville Blvd.\nMonroeville\n,\nPA\n15146\nT:\n(412) 373-4200\nF:\n(412) 373-4250\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nOpen 24/7/365\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nServices\nPet Owners\nFor Veterinarians\nCareers\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nBlog\nOrder Food & Medicine\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
